# The 1Password service-account token for a project's varlock schema, which
# imports this file with allowMissing=true. On a Mac with the 1Password app the
# file is absent and the plugin's allowAppAuth takes over; this Mac has no app to
# unlock, so the token is read from the file claude/signing-key.sh stored, at each
# load. @internal keeps it out of every process varlock starts.
#
# @type=opServiceAccountToken @internal
OP_TOKEN=exec(`cat ~/.config/op/service-account-token`)
